              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is a backpack leaf blower worth it?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                For half an acre or more, or properties with heavy wet leaves, yes. A backpack moves weight onto your shoulders and carries more power than a handheld, so big cleanups take less time and less forearm strain. For small lots, a good handheld is usually enough and easier to store.
